```java
// Vulnerable code: SQL Injection due to concatenating user input
String username = request.getParameter("username"); // User-controlled input
String query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '" + username + "'"; // Unsafe concatenation
Statement statement = connection.createStatement();
ResultSet result = statement.executeQuery(query); // Direct execution of raw query
```

***
```java
// Fixed code: Uses PreparedStatement to prevent SQL Injection
String username = request.getParameter("username"); // User-controlled input
String query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?"; // Parameterized query
PreparedStatement statement = connection.prepareStatement(query);
statement.setString(1, username); // Input safely sanitized and bound
ResultSet result = statement.executeQuery();
```

